</svg>		</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e045eb9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="e045eb9" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">MISSÃO</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5c90408 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="5c90408" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Nossa missão é apoiar as iniciativas das Secretarias Municipais e da Prefeitura da maior capital da América do Sul.</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c00609f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="c00609f" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-fe1fa27 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer" data-id="fe1fa27" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="spacer.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-spacer">
			<div class="elementor-spacer-inner"></div>
		</div>
						</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-050a54c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="050a54c" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-55d177e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="55d177e" data-element_type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b4575fc elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="b4575fc" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">AUDITÓRIO BRUNO COVAS</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-32e723a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="32e723a" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Localizado no centro histórico de São Paulo, a sede da SPTuris possui um espaço de eventos para quase 100 pessoas, disponível para locação tanto de secretarias municipais e órgãos públicos, como também de empresas privadas.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-34c3113 elementor-align-left elementor-mobile-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="34c3113" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
					<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="https://spturis.com/auditorio-bruno-covas/">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
									<span class="elementor-button-text">CONHEÇA O ESPAÇO</span>
					</span>
					</a>
				</div>
								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-67ddffc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="67ddffc" data-element_type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-95f5348 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="95f5348" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
